{
  "category": "Big Voice Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "LOUDRED’s bellowing can completely decimate a wood-frame house. It uses its voice to punish its foes. This POKéMON’s round ears serve as loudspeakers.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "LOUDRED shouts while stamping its feet. After it finishes shouting, this POKéMON becomes incapable of hearing anything for a while. This is considered to be a weak point.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It positions the round speakers on its head to assail foes with ultrasonic waves at massive volume. It builds power by stomping the ground.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it stamps its feet and bellows, it generates ultrasonic waves that can blow apart a house.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it stamps its feet and bellows, it generates ultrasonic waves that can blow apart a house.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
