    {
      "text": "Loudred’s bellowing can completely decimate a wood-frame house. It uses its voice to punish its foes. This Pokémon’s round ears serve as loudspeakers.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Loudred shouts while stamping its feet. After it finishes shouting, this Pokémon becomes incapable of hearing anything for a while. This is considered to be a weak point.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Loudred’s ears serve as speakers, and they can put out sound waves powerful enough to blow away a house.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "The force of this Pokémon’s loud voice isn’t just the sound—it’s also the wave of air pressure that blows opponents away and damages them.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
